    "reviews": "\u201cFor those who have been binge-watching the latest season of \u2018Stranger Things,\u2019 this like-minded genre mashup \u2026 may be a rather welcome dessert.\u201d<br>Los Angeles Times<br><br>\u201cIf this game is worse than death then boy I can\u2019t wait to die, because death must be awesome.\u201d<br>Rock, Paper, Shotgun<br><br>\u201cFeels personal and terrifying at the same time.\u201d<br>8.5 / 10 \u2013 CGM<br>",
